:: Check Quest Requirements [system] {"position":"1675,400","size":"100,100"}
/* For every quest line (setup.questLines, Define Quests): first jumps over the current quest if it is optional and its
   "skip" became true after the line reached it (setup.skipQuests), then advances the line if its current quest is a
   check quest that is met */
<<for _cqrKey range setup.questLines>><<run setup.skipQuests(State.variables[_cqrKey], true)>><<CheckActiveQuestForCompletion `State.variables[_cqrKey]`>><</for>>
